OL,3,GNEWSA'We'll find way to save Jodrell
OL,4,ABank,' Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has vowed
OL,7,Fto save the UK's largest telescope at
OL,8,Fthe Jodrell Bank Observatory.
OL,10,FThe Lovell telescope, which has stood
OL,11,Fin Cheshire since 1957, is the world's
OL,12,Fthird-largest steerable radio
OL,13,Ftelescope.
OL,15,FBut in July this year, UK Research and
OL,16,FInnovation (UKRI) said the site would
OL,17,Fnot be prioritised for further funding
OL,18,Fafter its current agreement ended in
OL,19,FMarch 2028.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
