OL,3,GNEWSA'We'll find way to save Jodrell
OL,4,ABank,' Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said: "Every one of my
OL,7,Fgeneration went on a school trip to
OL,8,FJodrell Bank, and there is no way that
OL,9,Fwe can see its demise, and it won't
OL,10,Fhappen under my government."
